## ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
## nexus | ItacaChamber.tl208.config.mac
##
## Template. The job script replaces @SEED@, @START_ID@ and @OUTPUT@.
## Gammas of the 2614.511 keV line of 208Tl, emitted isotropically from the inner
## surface of the gas cylinder.
## Events are saved when the energy deposited in the gas lies in the window below.
## Written by scripts/iitaca/write_iitaca_macros.jl from the cards of config/iitaca
## (variant II_L1000_D500_P2). Do not edit: change the cards and write it again.
## ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

/run/verbose 1
/event/verbose 0
/tracking/verbose 0
/process/em/verbose 0

/control/execute macros/iitaca/II_L1000_D500_P2/ItacaChamber.mac

/Generator/SingleParticle/particle gamma
/Generator/SingleParticle/min_energy 2614.511 keV
/Generator/SingleParticle/max_energy 2614.511 keV
/Generator/SingleParticle/region INNER_SURFACE

/Actions/DefaultEventAction/min_energy 2420. keV
/Actions/DefaultEventAction/max_energy 2490. keV

/nexus/random_seed @SEED@
/nexus/persistency/start_id @START_ID@
/nexus/persistency/output_file @OUTPUT@
/nexus/persistency/event_type background
